So this morning,
we just announced

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:19.610
that there's now over 600,000
developers on the Dialogflow

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:23.090
platform, which is crazy, right?

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:27.620
This is in just over a year
